(Chapter 1 — Why niche sites still win) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(The web keeps being declared dead, and niche sites keep paying rent. The reason is structural:) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(search engines and feeds reward specificity. A page that answers one question completely will) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 644.10 Td
(outrank a homepage that gestures at a hundred topics. Advertisers pay for intent, and intent) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 628.15 Td
(lives in the long tail.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 606.20 Td
(Three properties make a niche site durable:) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 584.25 Td
(• Answer-shaped content. The unit of value is the answered question, not the article. If a reader) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 568.30 Td
(arrives with "how do I season a cast iron skillet," the page that ends their search wins.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 550.35 Td
(• Compounding archives. Each post is a small asset. A hundred assets cross-link, rank, and) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 534.40 Td
(attract subscribers. The archive is the product.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 516.45 Td
(• Clear monetization fit. Some niches monetize through affiliates \(gear, software\), some through) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 500.50 Td
(sponsors \(local services, B2B\), some through digital products \(templates, guides\). Pick the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 484.55 Td
(niche after you pick the money model, not before.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 466.60 Td
(The failure mode is also structural: thin content. A hundred pages that say nothing will not) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 450.65 Td
(compound; they will decay. The entire rest of this book is about producing volume without) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 434.70 Td
(producing thinness.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 412.75 Td
(Operator's rule: one niche, one money model, one hundred genuinely useful pages before you) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 396.80 Td
(judge anything.) Tj
F1 9 Tf
303.50 40 Td
(4) Tj
