F1 11 Tf
72.00 572.20 Td
(questions that matter most, how it makes money, and what "good" looks like.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 540.25 Td
(2. The content engine) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 516.25 Td
(The pipeline that turns the niche map into drafts on a schedule: research, drafting, quality) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 500.30 Td
(checks, rendering to static HTML, deployment. Cadence is a design choice — hourly is) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 484.35 Td
(aggressive; daily is sane; weekly is a newsletter with extra steps. Whatever you choose, the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 468.40 Td
(engine must be boring: same inputs, same checks, same outputs, every run.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 436.45 Td
