F1 11 Tf
72.00 412.45 Td
(Where readers meet the work: the sites themselves, RSS feeds, newsletters, marketplaces.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 396.50 Td
(Static HTML is underrated — it's fast, cheap, cacheable, and nearly impossible to break. Each) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 380.55 Td
(site should have a feed from day one; feeds are the cheapest subscription mechanism ever) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 364.60 Td
(invented.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 332.65 Td
(4. The monetization layer) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 308.65 Td
(How attention becomes money: affiliate links with honest disclosure, sponsor slots with a real) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 292.70 Td
(rate card, digital products with instant delivery, and a bookstore for your own titles. Every layer) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 276.75 Td
(must work without you touching it — checkout, delivery, receipts, recovery.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 254.80 Td
(Between the organs sit contracts: the content engine promises the distribution surface valid) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 238.85 Td
(HTML; the monetization layer promises the content engine product metadata; the niche map) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 222.90 Td
(promises everyone a stable vocabulary. Write these contracts down. When something breaks at) Tj
