(Chapter 3 — Choosing niches with data) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(Hunches are expensive. A niche that can't monetize will eat a year of compute and produce a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(beautiful archive nobody pays for. Choose with a scorecard.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 628.10 Td
(The five-factor scorecard) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 604.10 Td
(Score each candidate niche from 1 to 5 on:) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 582.15 Td
(• Question density. Are there at least 200 distinct questions people actually ask? Check search) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 566.20 Td
(suggestions, forums, and community Q&A. Fewer than 200 means you'll run out of things to) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 550.25 Td
(say.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 532.30 Td
(• Buyer intent. Do the questions lead to purchases? "Best espresso grinder under $300" beats) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 516.35 Td
("history of espresso" by an order of magnitude in revenue per thousand readers.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 498.40 Td
(• Affiliate depth. Are there real products with real programs? Count the programs, note the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 482.45 Td
(commissions, and verify the links work. Three solid programs beat thirty dead ones.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 464.50 Td
(• Competition shape. You're not trying to outrank giants; you're trying to find questions giants) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 448.55 Td
(answer badly. Look for thin top results, outdated pages, and forums outranking publishers —) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 432.60 Td
(those are gaps.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 414.65 Td
(• Your unfair advantage. Data access, lived experience, tooling, or distribution. If you have) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 398.70 Td
(none, pick a niche where the work itself is the advantage: testing, measuring, comparing —) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 382.75 Td
(things lazy competitors won't do.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 364.80 Td
(Total the scores. Anything under 15 is a no. Anything over 20 deserves a pilot.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 332.85 Td
(The pilot: ten pages, one month) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 308.85 Td
(Before committing to a niche, publish ten pages and watch for thirty days. Measure:) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 292.90 Td
(impressions, clicks, time on page, and — the one that matters — email signups per hundred) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 276.95 Td
(visitors. A niche with traffic but no signups has an audience but not a business. A niche with) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 261.00 Td
(signups but no traffic needs distribution work, which is solvable.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 239.05 Td
(Kill pilots fast. The scorecard plus the pilot will save you from your two most expensive) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 223.10 Td
(mistakes: the niche you love that can't pay, and the niche that pays that you'll hate operating.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 201.15 Td
(Operator's rule: ten pages, thirty days, one decision. No sunk-cost extensions.) Tj
