(Chapter 4 — Content systems that don't rot) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(Volume without a system produces sludge. A content system has four parts: archetypes, briefs,) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(checks, and feedback.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 628.10 Td
(Archetypes) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 604.10 Td
(Every post belongs to an archetype with a fixed shape: the comparison, the how-to, the glossary) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 588.15 Td
(entry, the checklist, the teardown, the FAQ. Archetypes do three jobs: they tell the drafter what) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 572.20 Td
(to produce, they tell the reader what to expect, and they tell your quality checks what to verify.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 556.25 Td
(Six archetypes are plenty. Twenty is a taxonomy project, not a publishing system.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 524.30 Td
(Briefs) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 500.30 Td
(A brief is the contract between the niche map and the draft: the question, the reader's situation,) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 484.35 Td
(the archetype, the facts that must appear, and what "done" means. Generate briefs from data —) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 468.40 Td
(top questions, product specs, community threads — not from inspiration. A good brief makes a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 452.45 Td
(mediocre draft useful; a bad brief makes a good draft irrelevant.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 420.50 Td
(Checks) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 396.50 Td
(Automated checks are your editors. Minimum viable checks:) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 374.55 Td
(• Structure: does the draft match its archetype's shape? \(Headings present, comparison has a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 358.60 Td
(table, how-to has steps.\)) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 340.65 Td
(• Substance: minimum length, no placeholder text, links resolve, product names match the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 324.70 Td
(catalog.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 306.75 Td
(• Honesty: affiliate disclosures present, claims hedged where they should be, no fabricated) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 290.80 Td
(specs or prices.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 272.85 Td
(• Freshness: dates current, no references to expired events or discontinued products.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 254.90 Td
(Checks should block publication, not just warn. A warning nobody reads is decoration.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 222.95 Td
(Feedback) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 198.95 Td
(Close the loop: which archetypes earn signups? Which pages get cited? Which products) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 183.00 Td
(convert? Feed those measurements back into the briefs — more of what works, less of what) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 167.05 Td
(doesn't. A content system that doesn't learn is just a printer.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 145.10 Td
(Operator's rule: archetypes are law, briefs are contracts, checks are editors, metrics are the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 129.15 Td
(curriculum.) Tj
