(Chapter 5 — The monetization ladder) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(Attention is inventory. The ladder describes how you sell it, from lowest to highest effort — and,) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(usually, lowest to highest margin.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 628.10 Td
(Rung 1: Affiliate links) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 604.10 Td
(The easiest money and the easiest to get wrong. Rules: only recommend products the content) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 588.15 Td
(genuinely evaluated, disclose every affiliate relationship plainly, and track every link. A link that) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 572.20 Td
(404s is a leak; a disclosure that's missing is a liability. Affiliate revenue is proportional to buyer) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 556.25 Td
(intent, which is why Chapter 3 matters.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 524.30 Td
(Rung 2: Sponsors) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 500.30 Td
(One sponsor slot, sold simply. You need three artifacts: a rate card with real numbers, a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 484.35 Td
(one-page media kit, and a reporting template. Price on value delivered \(targeted readers with) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 468.40 Td
(intent\), not on vanity metrics. Start with a single slot per site; scarcity is a feature.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 436.45 Td
(Rung 3: Digital products) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 412.45 Td
(Templates, checklists, prompt packs, spreadsheets — the things your readers would otherwise) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 396.50 Td
(build themselves. Digital products have near-zero marginal cost, which means the work is all) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 380.55 Td
(upfront: the product must be genuinely useful on first open. Price on the value of the problem) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 364.60 Td
(solved, not the size of the file. Deliver instantly, gate with expiring links, and make recovery) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 348.65 Td
(self-serve — every support email you avoid is margin.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 316.70 Td
(Rung 4: Your own books) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 292.70 Td
(The top rung, and the subject of Part II. A book is the highest-trust product you can sell: it says) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 276.75 Td
(you know the subject well enough to sustain an argument for two hundred pages. Books also do) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 260.80 Td
(something products can't — they turn readers into believers, and believers into customers for) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 244.85 Td
(everything else on the ladder.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 222.90 Td
(Climb in order. Each rung funds the next, and each rung's audience becomes the next rung's) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 206.95 Td
(customers.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 185.00 Td
(Operator's rule: never add a rung until the one below it runs without you.) Tj
