(Chapter 6 — SEO for programmatic publishing) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(Programmatic publishing has a reputation problem, and it earned it: thousands of) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(auto-generated pages with shuffled synonyms deserve to rank nowhere. The difference) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 644.10 Td
(between spam and a publication is editorial intent, and search engines are increasingly good at) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 628.15 Td
(detecting which one they're looking at.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 596.20 Td
(What actually ranks) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 572.20 Td
(• Satisfying the query completely. The page that ends the search wins. Cover the question, the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 556.25 Td
(follow-up questions, and the edge cases. Length is a side effect of completeness, not a goal.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 538.30 Td
(• Original information. Measurements, tests, comparisons you ran yourself, data you compiled.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 522.35 Td
(Anything a rewriter can't produce. This is your moat.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 504.40 Td
(• Site-level coherence. A hundred pages on espresso grinders tell the engine what the site is) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 488.45 Td
(about. A hundred random pages tell it nothing. Topical authority is real; it's just earned slowly.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 470.50 Td
(• Clean technicals. Fast pages, valid HTML, sensible headings, working internal links, a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 454.55 Td
(sitemap, a feed. None of this ranks you; all of it un-blocks you.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 426.60 Td
(What gets you ignored) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 402.60 Td
(Doorway pages, spun text, keyword-stuffed headings, fake review stars, and — the quiet killer —) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 386.65 Td
(publishing faster than you can quality-check. If your checks from Chapter 4 are real, scale is) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 370.70 Td
(safe. If they're decorative, scale is a footprint that says "penalize me.") Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 338.75 Td
(The honest keyword workflow) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 314.75 Td
(Start from real questions \(forums, search suggestions, support inboxes\). Group them by intent.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 298.80 Td
(Assign each group an archetype. Write the brief. Draft, check, publish. Then watch Search) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 282.85 Td
(Console like a hawk for the first ninety days: impressions without clicks mean your titles need) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 266.90 Td
(work; clicks without signups mean the page needs a better offer; neither means the question) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 250.95 Td
(had no demand, and you should stop covering its siblings.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 229.00 Td
(Operator's rule: publish like an editor, measure like a scientist, prune like a gardener.) Tj
