F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(A publication without a store is a hobby with analytics. The store is where the ladder from) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(Chapter 5 becomes infrastructure: product catalog, checkout, delivery, recovery. Every piece) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 644.10 Td
(must work while you sleep, because the whole point is that it does.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 612.15 Td
(The catalog is the contract) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 588.15 Td
(Prices live on the server, never in the browser. The client sends product IDs and quantities; the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 572.20 Td
(server looks up names and prices from its own catalog. This isn't paranoia — it's the difference) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 556.25 Td
(between a store and a suggestion box. Anyone can edit JavaScript in their browser; nobody) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 540.30 Td
(should be able to edit your prices.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 508.35 Td
(Checkout) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 484.35 Td
