F1 11 Tf
72.00 468.40 Td
(You get PCI compliance, mobile wallets, and tax handling for free. Your job is the session:) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 452.45 Td
(correct line items from the server catalog, the buyer's email, metadata that ties the payment) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 436.50 Td
(back to your records \(product IDs, site\), and success/cancel URLs that actually exist. Test the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 420.55 Td
(full loop in test mode before you ever take a real dollar: click, pay with a test card, land on) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 404.60 Td
(success, receive the product.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 372.65 Td
(Delivery) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 348.65 Td
(Digital delivery has one requirement: the buyer gets the file, and nobody else does. The pattern) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 332.70 Td
(that works: on payment confirmation \(via webhook, never via the browser redirect\), record the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 316.75 Td
(purchase, mint a signed, expiring access token, and serve files only through a gated endpoint) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 300.80 Td
(that verifies the token and the purchase. Never put deliverable files under a public static path.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 284.85 Td
(Never trust the success-page URL as proof of payment — webhooks are the source of truth; the) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 268.90 Td
(redirect is a courtesy.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 236.95 Td
(Recovery) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 212.95 Td
(Buyers lose emails, links expire, devices change. Recovery must be self-serve: enter your) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 197.00 Td
(email, get a fresh access link. Every recovery request that needs a human is a failure of design.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 181.05 Td
(Log everything — checkout started, payment completed, delivery granted, link renewed — so) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 165.10 Td
(when something does go wrong, you can see exactly where.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 143.15 Td
(Operator's rule: the browser is a liar; the webhook is the truth; the catalog is the law.) Tj
F1 9 Tf
301.00 40 Td
(10) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
13 0 obj
<< /Length 2327 >>
stream
BT
F2 20 Tf
72.00 710.00 Td
(Chapter 8 — Operations: dashboards, cron, and calm) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(An autonomous system still needs an operator — just not a full-time one. Operations means) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(three things: seeing what's happening, doing routine work on schedule, and staying calm when) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 644.10 Td
(something breaks.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 612.15 Td
(Dashboards) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 588.15 Td
(One page that answers: is it alive, is it publishing, is it earning? Health checks, recent) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 572.20 Td
(publications, checkout conversion, revenue. Keep the ops dashboard off the public homepage —) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 556.25 Td
(buyers shouldn't see your internals, and you shouldn't have to explain them. A dashboard you) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 540.30 Td
(check for five minutes a morning beats a wall of metrics you never open.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 508.35 Td
(Cron) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 484.35 Td
(Scheduled jobs are the heartbeat: generate the next batch of content, rebuild indexes, renew) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 468.40 Td
(feeds, reconcile payments. Every job needs three properties: idempotency \(running twice is) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 452.45 Td
(safe\), a secret \(nobody else can trigger it\), and logging \(you can see what it did\). A cron job) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 436.50 Td
(without idempotency is a incident waiting for a retry.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 404.55 Td
(Calm) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 380.55 Td
(Things will break: a provider goes down, a webhook fails, a deploy wipes ephemeral state.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 364.60 Td
(Design for it now: keep purchase records somewhere durable \(a disk that survives deploys, or a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 348.65 Td
(real database — never the instance's throwaway filesystem\), make webhooks retry-safe by) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 332.70 Td
(recording idempotently on the provider's session ID, and keep a runbook for the three failures) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 316.75 Td
(you've actually seen, not the thirty you imagine.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 294.80 Td
(The goal isn't zero incidents. It's incidents you notice in minutes, diagnose from the dashboard,) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 278.85 Td
(and fix without heroics.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 256.90 Td
(Operator's rule: durable state, idempotent jobs, one dashboard, five minutes a morning.) Tj
F1 9 Tf
301.00 40 Td
(11) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
14 0 obj
<< /Length 1792 >>
stream
BT
F2 20 Tf
72.00 710.00 Td
(Chapter 9 — Legal and trust) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(Trust is the product. Everything legal is downstream of that sentence.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 644.05 Td
(Disclosures) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 620.05 Td
(Affiliate relationships, sponsorships, AI involvement in content — disclose all of it, plainly, where) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 604.10 Td
(the reader will see it. Disclosure isn't just compliance; it's positioning. Readers forgive) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 588.15 Td
(monetization they can see. They punish monetization they discover.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 556.20 Td
(Privacy) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 532.20 Td
(Collect the minimum: an email for delivery and receipts. Say what you store, how long, and why.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 516.25 Td
(Never sell buyer data — not because it's illegal \(it often isn't, in the fine print\), but because a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 500.30 Td
(bookstore that sells its customers has no customers.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 468.35 Td
(Refunds) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 444.35 Td
(Digital products need a clear refund policy, stated before purchase. Ours: if the file doesn't) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 428.40 Td
(match its description, you get your money back — no interrogation. Chargebacks cost more than) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 412.45 Td
(refunds, and a generous policy is a conversion feature. Mean it.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 380.50 Td
(Terms and contact) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 356.50 Td
(Real terms of service, a real privacy policy, a real contact address. Placeholder links) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 340.55 Td
(\(javascript:void\(0\)\) are a confession: they tell every buyer the store isn't finished. Finish it before) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 324.60 Td
(you take money.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 302.65 Td
(Operator's rule: if you wouldn't sign it, don't ship it.) Tj
F1 9 Tf
301.00 40 Td
(12) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
