<< /Length 2188 >>
stream
BT
F2 20 Tf
72.00 710.00 Td
(Chapter 10 — From one site to a network) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(One site is a publication. Ten sites are a network, and networks have properties single sites) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(don't.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 628.10 Td
(Shared infrastructure) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 604.10 Td
(One content engine, one checkout, one fulfillment system, one dashboard — serving every site.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 588.15 Td
(The marginal cost of the eleventh site should be near zero: a niche-map entry, a theme, a) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 572.20 Td
(cadence. If launching a site takes more than an afternoon, your infrastructure isn't shared; it's) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 556.25 Td
(repeated.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 524.30 Td
(The offer ladder, network-wide) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 500.30 Td
(Each site climbs its own ladder \(Chapter 5\), but the ladders connect: the espresso site's buyer is) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 484.35 Td
(the kitchen site's prospect. Cross-promote honestly — recommendations between your own) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 468.40 Td
(properties must be as genuine as any affiliate pick, or they rot trust across the whole network.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 436.45 Td
(Portfolio strategy) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 412.45 Td
(Not every site should grow forever. Some are cash cows, some are experiments, some are) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 396.50 Td
(feeders for the bookstore. Decide each site's role explicitly and review quarterly. Kill sites that) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 380.55 Td
(fail their role; sentimentality is not a strategy.) Tj
F2 14 Tf
72.00 348.60 Td
(The bookstore at the center) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 324.60 Td
(Here's the endgame: the network assembles audiences; the bookstore converts the deepest) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 308.65 Td
(trust into the highest-margin product. Every site's best readers become the bookstore's) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 292.70 Td
(customers. Every book's readers discover the sites. The flywheel is slow — books take real work) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 276.75 Td
(— but it's the only rung on the ladder your competitors can't copy by outbidding you.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 254.80 Td
(Operator's rule: the network finds readers; the bookstore keeps them.) Tj
F1 9 Tf
301.00 40 Td
(13) Tj
ET
