(Appendix — The 30-day launch checklist) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 676.00 Td
(Days 1–3: Foundation. Pick one niche with the scorecard. Define its money model. Write ten) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 660.05 Td
(briefs. Set up the site, the feed, and the analytics.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 638.10 Td
(Days 4–10: First pages. Publish the ten pilot pages. Wire affiliate links with disclosures. Set up) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 622.15 Td
(the newsletter capture.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 600.20 Td
(Days 11–17: The store. Catalog, checkout, webhooks, delivery, recovery — all in test mode. Run) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 584.25 Td
(a full test purchase end to end: click, pay, webhook, download, recover.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 562.30 Td
(Days 18–24: Trust. Terms, privacy, refunds, contact — all real. Success and cancel pages. Rate) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 546.35 Td
(card and media kit if sponsors fit the niche.) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 524.40 Td
(Days 25–30: Measure and decide. Thirty days of data on ten pages. Impressions, clicks,) Tj
F1 11 Tf
72.00 508.45 Td
(signups, revenue. Decide: scale, pivot, or kill. Then do it without ceremony.) Tj
F1 9 Tf
301.00 40 Td
(14) Tj
ET
